{"lyrics":"[Chorus]\n[00:02.44]I'll hop in the car with my friends and play my song\n[00:08.54]I hope the memories we make last all life long, yeah\n[00:15.02]I'll hop in the car with my friends and play my song, song (Ah)\n[00:21.44]Ain't no tellin' where we'll end up\n[00:22.44](D-D-Daytrip took it to ten, hey!)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:23.36]Last night was a blur, so, girl, I wasn't sure\n[00:28.42]If we made love, or if we made somethin' more\n[00:31.52]Last thing I remember is me walking out the door\n[00:34.68]Next thing you know, woke up on the floor\n[00:37.60]Um, I don't know whose house this is, but I know I'm in Hollywood\n[00:40.90]Scrambled for my keys, then I stumbled to the car\n[00:43.82]I look in the backseat, what do I see?\n[00:46.92]Bro passed out, layin' next to a bad broad\n[00:50.70]Looks like they had a good time\n[00:53.16]I must've too, 'cause for some reason I can't remember my night\n[00:57.04]Reach in my pockets, what do I find?\n[00:59.56]Half a Percocet, two-hundred dollars, and a weed pipe\n[01:03.28]That's when somebody hit my phone line\n[01:05.86]Saying, \"Yesterday was wild,\" asking if I'm alright\n[01:09.78]I don't know what happened, but I wanna know\n[01:12.44]I guess we gotta do it all over again tonight\n[Chorus]\n[01:18.24]I'll hop in the car with my friends and play my song\n[01:24.30]I hope the memories we make last all life long\n[01:30.82]I'll hop in the car with my friends and play my song, song\n[01:37.14]Ain't no tellin' where we'll end up\n[Verse 2]\n[01:41.02]Here we go again, woke up in a bed\n[01:44.16]But it wasn't my bed, whose is this?\n[01:47.32]Vision kinda blurry, I can't see shit\n[01:50.04]Wrapped around my body, I see two tattooed hands\n[01:53.62]Last night more blank than the night before\n[01:56.28]At least I made it to a bed, last time I woke up on the floor\n[01:59.98]All I could remember is a bitch screamin', \"More, more, more, more\"\n[02:06.42]Videos in my phone, we were in a high-speed chase in a white Rolls\n[02:11.02]Looks like we threw them hands too, here's a clue, knuckles bruised\n[02:14.58]And somebody else's blood on my elbow\n[02:17.18]Lately, I've been blackin' out, drugs gettin' too strong\n[02:20.50]Buyin' out the pills from the plug, money too long\n[02:23.74]I get high to let go and find out where I belong\n[02:26.76]Probably by my VLONE\n[02:28.40]Party with my demons\n[Chorus]\n[02:29.92]I'll hop in the car with my friends and play my song\n[02:40.10]I hope the memories we make last all life long\n[02:45.04]I'll hop in the car with my friends and play my song, song\n[02:52.86]Ain't no tellin' where we'll end up\n[02:59.28]I'll hop in the car with my friends and play my song\n[03:05.36]I hope the memories we make last all life long\n[03:11.88]I'll hop in the car with my friends and play my song, song\n[03:16.44]Ain't no tellin' where we'll end up","words":[[2.44,2.54,"I'll"],[2.62,2.94,"hop"],[3.04,3.1,"in"],[3.14,3.18,"the"],[3.7,3.98,"car"],[4.14,4.44,"with"],[4.5,4.74,"my"],[4.86,5.28,"friends"],[5.36,5.42,"and"],[5.48,5.64,"play"],[5.72,5.92,"my"],[6.08,6.44,"song"],[8.54,8.54,"I"],[8.7,8.94,"hope"],[9.08,9.14,"the"],[9.28,10.4,"memories"],[10.52,10.62,"we"],[10.84,11.2,"make"],[11.26,11.64,"last"],[11.74,12.04,"all"],[12.6,12.92,"life"],[13.02,13.32,"long,"],[13.76,14.02,"yeah"],[15.02,15.16,"I'll"],[15.2,15.56,"hop"],[15.66,15.7,"in"],[15.74,15.78,"the"],[16.3,16.64,"car"],[16.78,17.08,"with"],[17.14,17.38,"my"],[17.52,17.92,"friends"],[17.98,18.06,"and"],[18.12,18.26,"play"],[18.36,18.54,"my"],[18.7,19.14,"song,"],[19.3,19.7,"song"],[21.36,21.4,"(Ah)"],[21.44,21.52,"Ain't"],[21.56,21.58,"no"],[21.62,21.82,"tellin'"],[21.86,21.98,"where"],[22.08,22.18,"we'll"],[22.26,22.3,"end"],[22.38,22.4,"up"],[22.44,22.74,"(D-D-Daytrip"],[22.84,22.94,"took"],[23.02,23.04,"it"],[23.08,23.1,"to"],[23.16,23.2,"ten,"],[23.24,23.28,"hey!)"],[23.36,23.56,"Last"],[23.6,23.84,"night"],[23.9,24.0,"was"],[24.06,24.06,"a"],[24.12,24.26,"blur,"],[24.48,25.28,"so,"],[2